          </p>

          <p>
            Buy all the paint at once, and if it is tinted, ask for the same batch or box the cans together before you start. Small tint variations between cans show up clearly on a floor viewed at a low angle. Keep a quart of leftover paint, labeled with the room and the date, for touch-ups in high-wear spots.
          </p>
